<p>This step fully describes how to give your custom companion their own nightmare and how to control their behaviour in the fade.
</p><p>This tutorial and the gift handling are the hardest. There is so much stuff  to do for this, I hope I don't forget anything. If someone tries it sent  me message, tell me it worked. Otherwise I forgot something to tell you  here probably. So let's take it slow.
</p>
